olor":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-15T23:40:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:44:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGood Morning Fellow Godot Dev. I Started using Godot a 2 years ago on my phone but in Godot 4.7.2 I found a bug when you turn of emulate mouse from touch on mobile, basic UI elements do work like tab containers, sliders, scrollers etc and The InputEventMouseMotion works on mobile when mobile doesn't use mouse \n\nHopefully you guys fix the bug\n\nI love you guys bye ❤️\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid 13 - Godot 4.7.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nEmulate Mouse from touch bug\n\nIf it is turned of basic UI elements don't work\n\nI tried many ways in fixing it but doesn't seem to work\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nNo code cause the issues \n\nIt's a problem in the Pointing setting when you turn off Emulate Mouse from touch \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[TheAgents(Copy).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33518649/TheAgents.Copy.zip)\n\nI didn't turn off the setting in this project \n\nBut it's in pointing setting if your turn off Emulator Mouse From Touch on Mobile ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124519/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124519/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}